  "prompt": "Tìm hệ số của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></semantics></math> trong khai triển biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.",
