  "solution": "Áp dụng công thức nhị thức Newton, ta có\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>*</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nên khi nhân biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> với biểu thức bên phải của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>*</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được hệ số của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy hệ số của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></semantics></math> trong khai triển biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"theory-box note\"><div class=\"theory-label\">Chú ý</div>Nếu tìm tất cả các số hạng của khai triển, ta được\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTừ đó, cũng tìm được hệ số của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math>.</div>",
